      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12281/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer chicken breasts with water in a large pot until no longer pink inside, about 15 minutes; dice chicken into bite-sized pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tytU-d8HQ04NlfNLD2isYfoAuDc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-12281-chicken-pot-pie-i-VAT-step-01-f00e358f445a480aa8fa1c8dacc75a3b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12281/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, line the bottom and sides of a 9-inch pie plate with 1 pie crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sKuTuFXS2FAym6R0Le9pUfrE3Z4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-12281-chicken-pot-pie-i-VAT-step-03-f9ce8c64f6c24ece9f67d7dc2590402a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12281/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine canned vegetables, condensed soup, and diced chicken in a large bowl until well mixed; pour into the prepared crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EO1d7qtC1tRhyakdo2eM5bfCFis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-12281-chicken-pot-pie-i-VAT-step-04-5115920df42a405195c849eaf08092de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12281/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover pie with remaining crust. Crimp the crust edges; cut slits in top crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zEX4uc5FpHwJMUBkC2-ku09RIyY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-12281-chicken-pot-pie-i-VAT-step-05-32879dfa811948babd301a3e51f8227f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12281/step_05.webp"
